---
layout: base.njk
title: My Portfolio
description: "Bayon Mbayo — software developer building with AI agents. Portfolio featuring Natportal (species protection reporting) and WPOP (auditor application platform)."
---
<h1>Bayon Mbayo</h1>
<p>I'm building my professional portfolio, learning agentic programming as I go.</p>

<section id="about">
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <p>{{ about.intro }}</p>
</section>

<section id="projects">
    <h2>Projects</h2>
    <ul>
        {% for project in projects %}
        <li>
            <strong>{{ project.title }}</strong>
            <p>{{ project.description }}</p>
            {% if project.link %}<p><a href="{{ project.link }}">{{ project.link }}</a></p>{% endif %}
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
</section>

<section id="contact">
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <ul>
        {% for item in contact %}
        <li>{{ item.label }}: <a href="{{ item.href }}">{{ item.value }}</a></li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
</section>
